# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-9f8f4511f6dcbc4ebff29a9db7563f2c50b4e3ad "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]].

Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-846fa55e2f380d5e7609dd97a22e6febbd49849f "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
